    answer: "A Prince Edward Island PNP process should be assessed through the current PEI stream, expression-of-interest or invitation process, job or employer requirement and settlement evidence. Small-province programs can be especially sensitive to intake and labour-market priorities, so a historical profile match may not remain available.",
