    answer: "Territorial nominee programs are shaped by local labour-market needs, employer requirements and the applicant’s ability to live and work in the territory. Yukon, Northwest Territories and Nunavut should not be treated as one interchangeable route; confirm the exact territory and current program status.",
    heading: "What does a territory-focused application need to explain?",
