    answer: "After receiving a PGP invitation to apply, confirm that the invitation belongs to the sponsor, note the deadline and rebuild the application around the current checklist. The sponsor should verify income, family size, undertaking, relationship, applicant admissibility and every document requested by the invitation package.",
    heading: "How can a PGP invitation deadline be protected?",
