    answer: "A Super Visa for parents is a temporary-visit option with its own host, insurance, financial and medical requirements; the Parents and Grandparents Program is a permanent-residence sponsorship route with an invitation process. Families should choose the document based on the outcome they need.",
    heading: "What should the host and parents coordinate?",
