    answer: "Orphaned-relative sponsorship requires a careful relationship and dependency review, including the applicant’s age, family circumstances, identity, legal status and the sponsor’s eligibility. The category is narrow, so the family should test the facts against the current definition before relying on a general relative-sponsorship assumption.",
